    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Who in this world can escape death? No matter how extraordinary you are, with beauty that surpasses all, in the end, you will become a mere red skeleton; no matter how remarkable you are, ruling over vast lands, you will eventually turn into a handful of yellow earth. The story primarily follows Xiao Chen, who is chased by the imperial goddess Zhao Lin’er and accidentally stumbles into the wild Dragon Island in the Realm of Eternal Life. This is a road with no return, surrounded by beasts and enemies, coming from all directions. Every sight is an enemy. The attachment to his relatives, friends, and hometown has always supported him to fight and conquer in this foreign land, fighting against exotic beasts and slaying enemies. The passionate battle, the temptation of passion and desire, Xiao Chen pursues the footsteps of the immortal, slowly unveiling the veil of an ancient mythological world that has been sealed for endless years",
        "jpn": null
    },
